y affiliate","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Playa San Pedrito advanced surf","si_tag":"Surf / Ocean Adventures","status":"future","hook":"Powerful break for experienced surfers (no swimming)","bookable_category":"guided surf","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"activity affiliate","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1636027-d10954417-Reviews-Playa_San_Pedrito-El_Pescadero_Baja_California.html (Accessed 2026-07-04)","si":"Surf / Ocean Adventures","blurb":"Powerful break for experienced surfers (no swimming)","commission":"activity affiliate","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Desert-wellness retreat (Paradero-class)","si_tag":"Wellness & Spa","status":"future","hook":"Sierra-La-Laguna desert wellness immersion","bookable_category":"resort / host-Virtuoso","tier":"luxury","commission_path":"on application / host program","source":"https://cabovisitor.com/where-to-stay-in-todos-santos/ (Accessed 2026-07-04)","timing":"November–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"wellness","blurb":"Sierra-La-Laguna desert wellness immersion","when":"November–April","commission":"on application / host program","accessed":"2026-07-04"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is Todos Santos known for?","a":"It''s a designated Pueblo Mágico — Baja''s Pacific art town of galleries, mango orchards and the mythic Hotel California (the Eagles'' band denies a direct link), an hour and a world away from the Los Cabos corridor. Come for galleries, sunsets and surf, not a swim resort.","source":"loscabosguide.com / incabotravel.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"When can I see whales from Todos Santos?","a":"Late December through April, best January–March, when gray and humpback whales pass the Pacific coast on Punta Lobos panga tours; multi-hour or overnight Magdalena Bay extensions reach the gray-whale nursery for close, calf encounters.","source":"todossantosvillarentals.com / serendipityventures.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Which Todos Santos beaches are safe to swim?","a":"Very few — Playa Los Cerritos is the area''s safest swim (and a good all-round surf break), while San Pedrito, La Cachora and La Poza are for surfing or sunset walks only. Match the break to your skill and use local surf schools.","source":"amyrextodossantos.com / cabovisitor.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"Is Todos Santos safe to visit?","a":"Yes — freely bookable. Baja California Sur is US State Dept Level 2 (May 29, 2026) and one of Mexico''s safer states; there''s no major hospital in town, so serious cases route ~1 hour to Los Cabos or La Paz.","source":"travel.state.gov, 2026-05-29 / loscabosguide.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What''s the real danger here?","a":"The Pacific surf, not crime. Most Todos Santos beaches have strong rip currents and backwash that have caused drownings — do not swim them; stick to the Cerritos protected zone and defer to on-the-ground flags. Hurricane season runs Jun–Nov.","source":"amyrextodossantos.com / mexiconewsdaily.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Todos Santos Travel Guide — Pueblo Mágico Art Town, Surf & Whales | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Baja''s Pacific art town: Hotel California, gallery walks, Cerritos surf, offshore whale-watching, and straight beach-safety guidance (most beaches are riptide-dangerous).","slug":"todos-santos-mexico","primary_keyword":"Todos Santos Mexico travel guide","long_tail":["Todos Santos beaches safe to swim","Cerritos vs San Pedrito surf","Hotel California Todos Santos","whale watching Todos Santos","best boutique hotels Todos Santos"],"search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["qué hacer en Todos Santos Pueblo Mágico","playas de Todos Santos se puede nadar","Hotel California Todos Santos","surf Playa Cerritos San Pedrito","avistamiento de ballenas Todos Santos","hoteles boutique Todos Santos"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By 